# INVUSER.KEY - a key script of INVWIN (SRC/WIN/INVWIN.C) over the serial
# link to INVSERV on the data TEST/KEYS/SEED.REQ seeds, run by
# TEST/WIN/winser.sh: a login at level 3, Admin > Users, a new user TEMP
# at level 1 with a password, NEWBIE's password reset, ESC back to the
# item list, Admin > Sessions, log-out and the end from the login dialog.
# No snapshot shows the user list, as its last logins are the server
# machine's dates, the day of the run.  Every password goes in key
# by key, so that the script, which lies in the Windows machine's memory,
# holds none of them for winser.sh's searches, which follow each USER
# LIST: the list opened, and fetched again after each save, once the
# dialog has wiped what was typed.  Every mode of Windows writes
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVUSR.SNP.
T ADMIN
K TAB
K SHIFT-R E T R O 1 9 8 6
K ENTER ALT-A U INS
T TEMP
# past the full name and the group to the level
K TAB TAB TAB
T 1
K TAB SHIFT-Q Z 7 SHIFT-W X 2 SHIFT-K P
K TAB SHIFT-Q Z 7 SHIFT-W X 2 SHIFT-K P
K ENTER
# NEWBIE's form, from its status past the user name, the full name, the
# group and the level to the password
K DOWN DOWN CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
K SHIFT-V B 9 SHIFT-R T 4 SHIFT-N Y
K TAB SHIFT-V B 9 SHIFT-R T 4 SHIFT-N Y
K ENTER ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-A S
S SESSIONS
K ESC ALT-F L
S LOGOUT
K ESC
S GONE
